How does the milestone help you see the work for the presentation as a group?

The milestone groups all work related to the Weeks 7–8 presentation into a single objective. Instead of viewing tasks separately, it provides a clear overview of the research, planning, design, and presentation materials needed for the expert-feedback presentation.

How is the milestone different from an Issue card on your Kanban board?

A milestone represents a larger goal composed of multiple tasks, while an Issue represents a specific piece of work. Issues move through the Kanban workflow, while the milestone tracks overall progress toward the presentation.